ere stratified by month of the year\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The prevented fraction was calculated as the number of averted illnesses divided by the total illnesses\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Estimates of 2013–14 influenza vaccination coverage were based on self-report or parental report of vaccination status\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}